{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/642600/extras/88cdd7ff99ef7dd816ac4da90b439e60.avif?t=1771528770\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/642600/extras/f0ebd010a04cd2e657d1d13a0f9e494d.poster.avif?t=1771528770\" width=780 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/642600/extras/f0ebd010a04cd2e657d1d13a0f9e494d.webm?t=1771528770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/642600/extras/f0ebd010a04cd2e657d1d13a0f9e494d.mp4?t=1771528770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zirodia is once peaceful planet then suddenly invaded by hostile mechanical alien race. In desperation, Zirodian found a strange message which revealed to be a blueprint of technology that could overcome invader's forces. Follow Queen Sehra story line as she fights her way to the source of Invader Planet which is located on Earth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/642600/extras/ce88e8d73c145b1b485066e138d7854b.avif?t=1771528770\" width=780 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/642600/extras/314eacaf38074c8758f1544db8a35d0d.poster.avif?t=1771528770\" width=780 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/642600/extras/314eacaf38074c8758f1544db8a35d0d.webm?t=1771528770\" type=\"video/we